WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:08.610
A radar view of Öresund. This radar pass covers the same strait as the optical shipping showcase, at a different time.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.450
The earlier image provides context. A recurring bright return does not by itself identify a vessel.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:25.090
No detection reaches score 0.7 in the displayed area. This does not mean the strait is empty.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:32.930
No AIS matching was performed. Radar positioning and predicted attributes remain uncertain.
